# Checkouts keep LF in every text file, whatever core.autocrlf says: the test
# fixtures and the signatures made from them are byte-exact, and a Windows
# checkout that turned them into CRLF broke both. Binaries are never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.p7m binary
*.p7s binary
*.p7e binary
*.p12 binary
*.der binary
*.tsr binary
*.tsq binary
*.asice binary
*.asics binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icc binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.odt binary
*.ods binary
*.odp binary
*.gz binary
